{"title": "Crown of Karsus", "pageid": 15716, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus", "categories": ["Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Crown_of_Karsus.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Crown_of_Karsus.webp/300px-Crown_of_Karsus.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Crown_of_Karsus.webp/450px-Crown_of_Karsus.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Crown_of_Karsus.webp/600px-Crown_of_Karsus.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Crown_of_Karsus.webp/300px-Crown_of_Karsus.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Crown_of_Karsus.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The Crown of Karsus</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>The Crown of Karsus</b> was created by Karsus, an archwizard from the Faerûn empire of <a href=\"/wiki/Netheril\" title=\"Netheril\">Netheril</a>. It is a very powerful item and anyone who wields it is said to obtain godlike powers. It is an invulnerable entity found <a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain#Atop_the_Netherbrain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Atop the Netherbrain</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>. Targeting it with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karsus%27_Compulsion\" title=\"Karsus' Compulsion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/25px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/38px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/50px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karsus' Compulsion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/25px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karsus%27_Compulsion\" title=\"Karsus' Compulsion\">Karsus' Compulsion</a> is the penultimate goal of the final battle to defeat <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Netherbrain\" title=\"The Netherbrain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/25px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/38px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/50px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Netherbrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png/25px-Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_The_Netherbrain.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Netherbrain\" title=\"The Netherbrain\">The Netherbrain</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>The crown was taken by the archdevil <a href=\"/wiki/Mephistopheles\" title=\"Mephistopheles\">Mephistopheles</a> and held in a vault for more than a thousand years. This was until someone managed to steal the crown from Mephistopheles and bring it back to Faerûn.\n</p><p>Three Netherstones were removed from the crown and distributed between <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/38px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/50px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orin the Red\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin the Red</a>. Through the power of the Netherstones the chosen can control whoever wears the crown, and the power that comes with it. At this point the game of Baldur's Gate 3 begins. For more information read <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\">The Dark Urge</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The goal of the final battle's first phase is ultimately to bring the party's designated <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Flayer\">Mind Flayer</a> to the Crown and attune to it using Karsus' Compulsion. The elder brain will speak through the crown each round, taunting and mocking the party. Once the chosen party member successfully casts the spell, a rift opens into the Netherbrain's psyche, where it can finally be defeated by the party.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Honour_Mode\">Honour Mode</span></h2>\n<p>On <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour Mode</a> the artifact itself gains a free spell once per round, akin to a <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary action\">Legendary Action</a>:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Karsite_Grip.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Karsite_Grip.webp/100px-Karsite_Grip.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Karsite_Grip.webp/150px-Karsite_Grip.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Karsite_Grip.webp/200px-Karsite_Grip.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Karsite_Grip.webp/100px-Karsite_Grip.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Karsite_Grip.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karsite_Grip\" title=\"Karsite Grip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp/40px-Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp/60px-Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp/80px-Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karsite Grip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp/40px-Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Karsite_Grip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karsite_Grip\" title=\"Karsite Grip\">Karsite Grip</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<dl><div><div><b>Damage: 8~64</b></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D8_Force.png/26px-D8_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D8_Force.png/40px-D8_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D8_Force.png/53px-D8_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D8_Force.png/26px-D8_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/D8_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">8d8</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div></div></div></div></dl> Crush a creature's being with pure Netherese energy that can fork across to three other targets within 8m.\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-footer\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\"> \n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 60 m (200 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 60 m (200 ft)</dd></dl>\n    </div></div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_characters\">Related characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/30px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/45px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/60px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/30px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/30px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/45px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/60px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/30px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/30px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/45px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/60px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orin the Red\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/30px-Portrait_Orin.png.web